+        // entire 8.6KB file into the heap in ~100ms on a slow link.
+        //
+        // Measured on this board before this was exposed: free heap fell from
+        // 7048 to 768 while serving one page, and a 241-byte allocation panicked.
+        // Expose the backlog so a streaming caller can wait for the wire instead
+        // of guessing at it.
+                size_t              txBacklog() const { return _queue.size(); }
+
